==English==
===Etymology===
From {{suffix|lamp|ing}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# A form of [[hunting]], at [[night]], in which bright lights or [[lamp]]s are used to [[dazzle]] the hunted [[animal]].

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{archaic}} [[bright|Bright]], [[flashing]], [[resplendent]].
